        <span itemprop="subject">a coating solution having a total solid content of 30%</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was prepared by dissolving 10 wt% of polyphenylsulfide (PPSU) having a melting temperature of 220° C. and 90 wt % of Al(OH) 3 powder (average particle diameter: 0.7  ⁇ m, porosity: 60%, surface area: 4.5 m 2 /g) were dissolved in dimethylaceteamide (DCB). Both surfaces of the base layer was coated with the coating solution by using a dip coating method, and then dried by a predetermined volume of air under humidity of 50% in an oven of 50° C. to remove dimethylaceteamide.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0137">
